# Deliverable (brief S6.3). See README.md in this directory for what each bundle shows.
#
# Raw run directories are named `<timestamp>-<id>` and are git-ignored: they accumulate, they
# are noisy, and the early ones predate the redaction fixes. The bundles kept here are named
# rather than timestamped, and were selected deliberately -- the full thread against the local
# target app, and the full thread again against live ParaBank.
